{"from":"DealFlow 360 Operations <avyayhkachhia@gmail.com>","to":"mehtasharv0208@gmail.com","subject":"[Executive Report] DealFlow 360 Governance & Sales Telemetry (All Time)","text":"DEALFLOW 360 — EXECUTIVE GOVERNANCE REPORT\n======================================================\nGenerated At:   Sep 6, 2026, 8:54 AM\nTrigger Type:   Admin On-Demand (Admin)\nFilter Period:  All Time\nRecipient:      mehtasharv0208@gmail.com\n\nEXECUTIVE OVERVIEW METRICS:\n- Quotes Created:           23\n- Confirmed Revenue:        ₹1,09,129.95\n- Avg Approval Turnaround:  0.0 hrs\n- Avg Confirmed Margin:     N/A\n\nSALES REP PERFORMANCE:\n• Rachel Rep: Quotes: 12, Won: 3, Rev: ₹91,100.00, Margin: 42.3325000000000000%\n• Mark Manager: Quotes: 2, Won: 2, Rev: ₹5,447.20, Margin: 51.2550000000000000%\n• avyay kachhia: Quotes: 0, Won: 0, Rev: ₹0.00, Margin: 0.00%\n• Clark Kent: Quotes: 1, Won: 0, Rev: ₹0.00, Margin: 0.00%\n\nRECENT AUDIT LEDGER:\n• [QT-20260906-G7O5MJ] Wayne Enterprises | REJECTED | ₹0.00\n• [QT-20260906-XVKDIA] Wayne Enterprises | PENDING_MANAGER | ₹10,200.00\n• [QT-20260906-ICO195] Wayne Enterprises | REJECTED | ₹0.00\n• [QT-20260906-HZJVI1] Wayne Enterprises | PENDING_MANAGER | ₹10,200.00\n• [QT-20260906-PX12HE] avyay enterprice | DRAFT | ₹3,849.00\n• [QT-20260906-0C31Q8] avyay enterprice | DRAFT | ₹249.00\n• [QT-20260906-IWY9AD] Wayne Enterprises | DRAFT | ₹27,000.00\n• [QT-20260906-DIZDSF] Initech Corporation | PENDING_MANAGER | ₹8,041.00\n\nLog into DealFlow 360 for full drilldowns:\nhttp://localhost:5173/catalog/governance\n\nDealFlow 360 Operations System\n======================================================","html":"\n    <!DOCTYPE html>\n    <html>\n    <head>\n      <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n      <title>DealFlow 360 Governance Report</title>\n    </head>\n    <body style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; padding: 24px; color: #1e293b;\">\n      <div style=\"max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%); padding: 28px 32px; color: #ffffff;\">\n          <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n            <span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #f43f5e;\">ADMIN GOVERNANCE REPORT</span>\n            <span style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); color: #ffffff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px;\">Admin On-Demand (Admin)</span>\n          </div>\n          <h1 style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: #ffffff;\">Sales &amp; Governance Telemetry</h1>\n          <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8;\">Period: <strong>All Time</strong> | Generated: Sep 6, 2026, 8:54 AM</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"padding: 28px 32px;\">\n\n          <!-- 4 Executive KPI Cards -->\n          <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n            <tr>\n              <td style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; width: 25%; text-align: center;\">\n                <div style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Quotes Created</div>\n                <div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a;\">23</div>\n              </td>\n              <td style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; width: 25%; text-align: center;\">\n                <div style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Confirmed Rev</div>\n                <div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #059669;\">₹1,09,129.95</div>\n              </td>\n              <td style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; width: 25%; text-align: center;\">\n                <div style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Avg Turnaround</div>\n                <div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #0284c7;\">0.0 hrs</div>\n              </td>\n              <td style=\"background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; width: 25%; text-align: center;\">\n                <div style=\"font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Avg Margin</div>\n                <div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #7c3aed;\">N/A</div>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </table>\n\n          <!-- Sales Rep Leaderboard -->\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">Sales Representative Performance</h3>\n          <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 13px;\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; text-align: left;\">\n                <th style=\"padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569; text-transform: uppercase;\">Rep Name</th>\n                <th style=\"padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: center;\">Quotes</th>\n                <th style=\"padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: center;\">Won</th>\n                <th style=\"padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: right;\">Total Rev</th>\n                <th style=\"padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #475569; text-transform: uppercase; text-align: right;\">Margin</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              \n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;\">Rachel Rep</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: #475569;\">12</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; color: #059669;\">3</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;\">₹91,100.00</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right; color: #475569;\">42.3%</td>\n        </tr>\n      \n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;\">Mark Manager</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: #475569;\">2</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; color: #059669;\">2</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;\">₹5,447.20</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right; color: #475569;\">51.3%</td>\n        </tr>\n      \n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;\">avyay kachhia</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; color: #475569;\">0</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: center; font-weight: 600; color: #059669;\">0</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a;\">₹0.00</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: right; color: #475569;\">0.0%</td>\n        </tr>\n      \n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\">\n   