0; color: #059669; background: #ecfdf5; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">-9.00%</span>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 12px 10px; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;\">\n              ₹910.00\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 12px 10px; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">\n              ₹910.00\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n          <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;\">\n            <td style=\"padding: 12px 10px; vertical-align: top;\">\n              <strong style=\"color: #1e293b; font-size: 14px;\">iphonr 17 pro</strong>\n              <div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;\">SKU: PROD-944483</div>\n              \n              \n            </td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 12px 10px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155;\">\n              12\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 12px 10px; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;\">\n              ₹99,999.00\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 12px 10px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;\">\n              <span style=\"display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #059669; background: #ecfdf5; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;\">-12.00%</span>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 12px 10px; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;\">\n              ₹87,999.12\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 12px 10px; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">\n              ₹10,55,989.44\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        \n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n\n              <!-- Totals Breakdown Card -->\n              <div style=\"background-color: #f8fafc; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 28px;\">\n                <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; padding-bottom: 6px;\">Subtotal Amount:</td>\n                    <td style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #334155; font-weight: 600; text-align: right; padding-bottom: 6px;\">₹10,56,899.44</td>\n                  </tr>\n                  \n                  <tr style=\"border-top: 2px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; padding-top: 10px;\">Grand Total Confirmed:</td>\n                    <td style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #2563eb; text-align: right; padding-top: 10px;\">₹10,56,899.44</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Portal Access CTA Button -->\n              <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 20px 0;\">\n                <a href=\"http://localhost:3001/portal\" style=\"background-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; padding: 14px 32px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);\">\n                  View Order & Tracking in Customer Portal\n                </a>\n              </div>\n\n              <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 28px 0 18px 0;\" />\n              \n              <!-- Footer Note -->\n              <div style=\"color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                <p style=\"margin: 0 0 4px 0;\">DealFlow 360 Enterprise Sales & Operations Platform</p>\n                <p style=\"margin: 0;\">Have questions about your order? Reach out directly to your assigned sales representative at <a href=\"mailto:admin@acme.com\" style=\"color: #028